WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.298 --> 00:00:06.077
Find the test in «Tasks».

2
00:00:06.077 --> 00:00:09.512
Press «Start» to begin the test.

3
00:00:17.792 --> 00:00:26.051
An untimed test has no timer: «No time limit». Submit whenever you are ready.

4
00:00:26.051 --> 00:00:32.473
Choose the option you think is right. Your answer is saved automatically.

5
00:00:32.473 --> 00:00:39.552
Move between questions freely. At the end press «Submit».
